            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Quem paga um turno"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Each turn runs on the subscription of the person who speaks first, then on their key in Perspicax, then on the organization's key if an admin set one. A bot's routines always use its owner's credentials.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Each turn runs on the subscription of the person who speaks first, then on their key in Perspicax, then on the organization's key if an admin set one. A bot's routines always use its owner's credentials."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Chaque tour utilise d'abord l'abonnement de la personne qui parle, puis sa clé dans Perspicax, puis la clé de l'organisation si un admin en a configuré une. Les routines d'un bot utilisent toujours les identifiants de son propriétaire."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Cada turno usa primeiro a assinatura de quem fala, depois a chave dessa pessoa no Perspicax, depois a chave da organização se um admin a configurou. As rotinas de um bot sempre usam as credenciais do dono."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "An organization key is set on this server (Settings > Connections).": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
